<title>SPAIN: Spain's Andalusia to launch 15 bln pta 20-yr bond.</title>
<headline>Spain's Andalusia to launch 15 bln pta 20-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Spanish regional government of Andalucia is to launch 15 billion pesetas in 20-year bonds, co-lead manager CECA-Ahorro Corporacion Financiera said on Friday.</p>
<p>The bonds will have a yearly coupon of 6.90 percent, with a pay date of June 16, 1997 and maturity on June 16, 2017.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
